(text "OPTIONAL RECEIVER-END TERMINATION (R10-R12)\nNot fitted for initial short-cable commissioning.\nSelect for actual cable and encoder output capability (20 mA max).\nDo not fit 120 ohm by default without checking driver loading.\nA+/A-, B+/B-, Z+/Z- each use one twisted pair." (at 20.32 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e700affa-fddb-5fc8-8f83-c50f2e095d12"))
(text "400 P/R quadrature -> TIM3 x4 = 1600 counts/rev. Z = once/rev.\nCable colours shown apply to the Oriental Motor cable.\nConnector orientation: follow motor drawing/manual (not wire-side guess).\nUse shielded cable; bond shield at controller chassis entry when provided." (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "137a6ad4-a3c8-5225-902c-47219536a49c"))
(text "U2 needs 5 V. U3 needs 3.3 V and accepts 5 V on its inputs.\nGround U3 /OE1-/OE3. Disable its unused fourth gate as drawn.\nU2 unused receiver inputs may float (documented fail-safe).\nPlace 100 nF directly at each IC supply; add 1 uF nearby." (at 190.5 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c65bc15b-ee93-5693-8ba5-b5d396361204"))
(text "A/B -> PB4/PB5 hardware quadrature counter; Z -> PB6 rising-edge EXTI.\nThis drawing preserves SWD; PB4 is unavailable for full JTAG reset." (at 20.32 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "657f5f0e-bf89-56bc-86c9-f8790d22b456"))
